  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-chest-variants.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@lieonlion?sub_confirmation=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/youtube.svg\" alt=\"youtube\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/LieOnLion/More-Chest-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fLieOnLion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lieonlion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/LieOnLion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/patreon.svg\" alt=\"patreon\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieon-studios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/all-of-fabric-7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/featured-in-aof7.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h3>增添备受期待的更多箱子变体。</h3>\n<p>现在，每种木材都拥有专属的箱子，为你的建筑增添丰富多彩的储物空间。独特的设计让你再也不用担心默认箱子破坏你的风格。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://lieonstudios.github.io/assets/v3/project/mod/more-chest-variants/banner/chest-set.png\" alt=\"chest-set\"></p>\n<h3>以尽可能原版的方式为 Minecraft 添加新箱子。</h3>\n<p>在 <strong>Quad</strong> 的支持下新增：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>箱子可作为燃料投入熔炉燃烧（下界木材除外）</li>\n<li>下界木材箱子免疫火焰与岩浆</li>\n<li>所有箱子均可用于原版合成配方（如漏斗）</li>\n<li><strong>即将推出</strong> - 箱子将在自然结构中生成（需 Quad 1.3.0-beta.1 及以上版本）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>星球大战日</h2>\n<p>“更多箱子变体”于 2023 年 5 月 4 日发布。为此，从 5 月 3 日至 5 月 5 日，你的箱子将显示特殊的星球大战纹理。愿原力与你同在。</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chested-companions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chested Companions</a></h2>\n<p>想让宠物随身携带小箱子吗？现在，借助 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chested-companions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chested Companions</a> 与“更多箱子变体”的支持，它们可以携带你喜爱的木材类型的箱子了！</p>\n<h2>一周年</h2>\n<p>“更多箱子变体”已于 2024 年 5 月 4 日迎来一周岁生日。在过去的一年里，它在 CurseForge 上获得了 28.2 万次下载，在 Modrinth 上获得了 9.3 万次下载，总下载量高达 <strong>37.5 万</strong> 次 :O。同时，该模组也已收录进 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/all-of-fabric-7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AOF7</a> 整合包中。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisect.lieonlion.dev%252fcurseforge%252fmcv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/banners/bisect-banner-spruce-chest.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>",
